# Bounded exceptions to scripts/security-scan.sh. Every entry needs all four:
#   the finding ID, why it does not apply or cannot be fixed yet, who approved
#   it, and an expiry date after which it must be re-assessed.
#
# Example:
# # unreachable code path in build-only tool; approved: <name>; expires 2026-12-31
# CVE-0000-00000
